    "9マスの外側の外枠まで指を滑らせて離すと、何も実行せずに閉じます。キーを押しても閉じます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Slide out to the frame around the nine buttons and lift your finger to close without running anything. Pressing a key also closes them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "9マスを開いたまま2本指でスワイプすると、ページが切り替わります。1つのアプリに最大3ページ置けます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With the buttons open, swipe with two fingers to change pages. Each app can have up to three pages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "9マスを開いたまま、左右の外枠に指を止めると、そちら側のページに切り替わります。1つのアプリに最大3ページ置けます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With the nine buttons open, hold your finger in the left or right frame to switch to the page on that side. Each app can have up to three pages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "9マスを開いている間、ポインタの移動とクリックを前面のアプリに渡さない" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep pointer movement and clicks from reaching the front app while the buttons are open"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "9マスを開いている間だけ、キーが押されたことを知る（押されたら閉じる）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notice key presses only while the buttons are open (a key press closes them)"
