      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Name the page after what it's for, like “Debug” or “Git”. The name also appears in the HUD title. Leave it empty to go back to “Page %lld”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「デバッグ」「Git」のように、何のページかを付けます。HUD（9マスの一覧）の題名にも出ます。空にすると「ページ %lld」に戻ります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
