      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "URL to open"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開くたびに HUD の下の画面の明るさを測り、アイコンを白か黒にします。macOS の「画面収録」の許可が要り、macOS 15 以降では月に一度ほど確認のダイアログが出ます。画像はその場で捨て、保存も送信もしません" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each time the HUD opens, Nonet measures the brightness of the screen under it and draws each icon in white or black. It needs the macOS Screen Recording permission, and on macOS 15 and later a confirmation dialog appears about once a month. The image is discarded at once; nothing is saved or sent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開くたびに HUD の下の画面の明るさを測り、アイコンを白か黒にします。画像はその場で捨て、保存も送信もしません" : {
